5,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I want to understand which past projects actually worked for the people using them.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I’m curious how much time we lose to out-of-service rooms during construction, and how those spaces are actually used afterward.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,I’m concerned about the staff burden. Who is left to maintain these new facilities once the contractors leave?,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I’m worried about the calendar. Every recent job hits an unpriced snag, and the schedule slips until a year of work is squeezed into the remaining weeks.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
